units metal
atom_style atomic
boundary p p f
lattice bcc 3.30 orient x 1 0 0 orient y 0 1 0 orient z 0 0 1
timestep 0.001

variable gap equal 15.0
region simbox block 0 66.0 0 66.0 0 213.0 units box
create_box 1 simbox
region target block 0 66.0 0 66.0 0 132.0 units box
create_atoms 1 region target
region projectile block 0 66.0 0 66.0 147.0 213.0 units box
create_atoms 1 region projectile
group target region target
group projectile region projectile

pair_style eam/alloy
pair_coeff * * ../../../potentials/prompt1.potential Nb

neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify delay 0 every 1 check yes
velocity all create 300.0 12345 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian
fix equil all nvt temp 300.0 300.0 0.1
thermo_style custom step temp etotal press
thermo 100
run 100000
unfix equil
velocity projectile add 0.0 0.0 -20.0 sum yes

fix impact all nve
run 200000